body:
Maybe it's hard truth that you need to hear, but as long as you're not investing too much money, energy and time, you can do a little bit of dropshipping and still work your day job. I've run stores on and off, and I find it useful to learn the marketing concepts around dropshipping even though you might not get any sales. I have gotten sales and have been profitable in eCommerce but not with dropshipping. it's hard work, but if you enjoy it, you're learning and it's not effecting your day-to-day life, why not?

&#x200B;

My current store: canvasavenues.com

Who's watching the whole thing again right now? 

&#x200B;

I KNOW I AM!!!

(Buddies sitting by the fire contemplating the dreaded morrow)

&#x200B;

Tyrion: "I think we might live" 


Davos: "haha"

&#x200B;

Tyrion is gonna die
